---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Inspired By Faith" description="Inspired by Cardinal George Pell — a message of faith, courage and hope that helped bring IICC Mission to life.">
  <nav class="breadcrumb wrap"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span><a href="/about-us">About Us</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span><span class="breadcrumb__current">Inspired By Faith</span></nav>

  <section class="hero-split">
    <div class="hero-split__text" style="background:var(--color-navy);">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--white">Our Story</span>
      <h1 class="section-title section-title--white" style="margin-block:0.5rem;">Inspired by <span class="text-amber">Cardinal George Pell</span></h1>
      <p class="section-desc section-desc--white" style="max-width:none;">A message of faith, courage and hope that helped bring IICC Mission to life.</p>
      <div class="hero-split__quote" style="position:static; width:auto; margin-top:1rem;">
        <span class="hero-split__quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
        <p class="hero-split__quote-text">The Catholic Church needs you. Your lived experience will be a treasure for many. Have courage my son, start doing something. Changes come always from the bottom and not from the top...</p>
        <span class="hero-split__quote-ref">— Cardinal George Pell</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-split__photo">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af2176?w=1000&q=80" alt="St Peter's Basilica" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card__title">A Friendship That Began Before Prison</span>
        <p class="card__body">
          Before my imprisonment, I had the privilege of knowing His Eminence Cardinal George
          Pell. A man of deep faith, wisdom and compassion. Our paths crossed through faith, ideas
          and a shared concern for people who are often forgotten by society.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card__title">Letters That Crossed Prison Walls</span>
        <p class="card__body">
          During my time in prison, I reconnected with Cardinal Pell. We exchanged letters and
          shared ideas about the needs of prisoners, their families, and the responsibility of the
          Church to accompany them. He listened. He cared. And he encouraged me to keep going.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--offwhite">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="quote-box">
        <span class="quote-box__mark">&ldquo;</span>
        <p class="quote-box__text">Words that inspired a mission. His words gave me the strength and confidence to believe that my experience could be used for something bigger than myself, and for the good of others.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="card__title">A Message That Changed My Direction</span>
        <p class="card__body">
          Without his encouragement, I may not have had the confidence to continue this journey.
          His support helped me understand that this mission was bigger than myself — it was a
          responsibility to serve others.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">From Experience to Service</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-block:0.5rem;">The Birth of IICC Mission</h2>
      <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none; margin-bottom:1rem;">
        Eight years in prison gave me a lived experience that cannot be taught in a classroom. It
        showed me the pain, the injustice, the isolation — and also the incredible capacity for
        change when a person is given hope, faith and support.
      </p>
      <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;">
        <strong>IICC Mission was born from that experience</strong>, and from the encouragement of
        a man who believed that my story could bring hope to many others.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="stat-band">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
      <p class="section-title section-title--white" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">A Legacy That Continues</p>
      <p class="section-desc section-desc--white" style="max-width:720px; margin-inline:auto;">
        Cardinal George Pell was a shepherd with a heart for those who suffer. His belief in the
        dignity of every person and his courage to speak the truth left a lasting impact on my
        life and on this mission.
      </p>
      <p class="text-amber" style="font-weight:700; margin-top:1rem;">His encouragement was the spark. This mission is the fruit.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap cta-band__inner">
      <div class="cta-band__text">
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--white">Forever in Our Prayers, Forever in Our Hearts</h2>
        <p class="section-desc section-desc--white">Thank you, Caro Padre, for believing in this mission, for encouraging me, and for reminding me that hope can be brought even to the darkest places.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/get-involved/prayer-request" class="btn btn--amber">Prayer Request &gt;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
